# Quick Start, found the first base, then open the F2, F3 and F4 screens
30 click 835 362
40 key Return            # PLANETFALL
44 key b                 # build a base with the colony pod
48 snap name-base
51 key Return            # accept the name
56 snap after-base
59 key F2
63 snap f2
66 key Escape
68 key F3
72 snap f3
75 key Escape
77 key F4
81 snap f4
84 key Escape
86 snap map
89 close
